WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.638
Lab 1 runs on a laptop
with Python 3.10 or later.

2
00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:10.101
Step one lists the read: two calls, two
read permissions, nothing that writes.

3
00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:12.976
Step two measures the fictional leavers:

4
00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:16.275
seven separated, one
cancelled, one not blocked.

5
00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:18.522
The median block is a quarter of an hour,

6
00:00:18.522 --> 00:00:23.366
but the ninetieth percentile is five and a
half hours against a four-hour threshold,

7
00:00:23.366 --> 00:00:25.893
and revocation's ninetieth percentile is a

8
00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:28.350
hundred and ten hours against twenty-four.

9
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.350
Ten findings and two warnings,
so it exits with code two.
